s as features are developed. Rather than merely focusing on testing completed changes, you’ll embed quality into our development process, championing best practices, improving test automation, and ensuring that great software is continuously delivered. ONCE YOU ARE HERE YOU WILL: Become an expert in the Talon.One product, and the foremost expert in the area for which your team is responsible. Collaborate with product, design, and engineering functions to ensure our delivered features are consistently of a high quality. Set the test strategy, engage critically with all functions from the outset of each feature. Ensure we have design and behavioral consistency between features, and strong, efficient test coverage at every level. Determine which test scenarios should be included in our suite of end-to-end automated tests, and implement those using Cypress. Willingness to proactively help junior Quality Engineers, provide timely feedback, and guide them to success. Contribute to Mentorship Programs and onboarding new joiners. WHAT WE NEED YOU TO BRING TO THE TABLE: Ability to communicate effectively and clearly in English, and precisely describe complex interactions Ability to architect a strong Test Strategy Strong track record in advocating for quality at all levels of development process 3 - 6+ years of experience delivering quality web applications with test automation, including REST APIs/GraphQL ABOUT TECHNOLOGY: Kubernetes running on Google Cloud PostgreSQL Golang for our API, core logic, and internal tooling TypeScript, React, Redux, and CSS modules for our web application Cypress for automated end-to-end testing WHAT'S IN IT FOR YOU: A Research and Development Department of 100+ of engineers, product managers and product designers in Berlin Leaders with 8+ years of experience building our promotions engine €1,000 annual learning budget and free German language courses to boost your skills 30 days of annual leave, plus extra paid days for your birthday and moving day Home office setup budget, a monthly home office allowance Freedom to work from abroad for up to 90 days worldwide! Mental health support with nilo.health and a discounted Urban Sports Club membership 20% company subsidy on your pension contributions BVG public transport ticket and welcome your furry friend in our dog-friendly Berlin office! Lease your ideal bike through BusinessBike Show more Show less Karrierestufe Management Beschäftigungsverhältnis Vollzeit Tätigkeitsbereich Ingenieurwesen und IT Branchen Softwareentwicklung Mit einer Empfehlung lassen sich Ihre Chancen auf ein Vorstellungsgespräch bei Talon.One verdoppeln. Wen kennen Sie bereits? Lassen Sie sich über neue Jobs im Bereich QA-Ingenieur in Berlin informieren. Einloggen, um Jobbenachrichtigung zu erstellen Stellenanzeigen Softwaretester-Jobs QA Engineer (Mid Level) Ähnliche Jobs Quality Engineer Quality Engineer Gallup Berlin Vor 1 Tag Software Engineer - Quality Engineering Software Engineer - Quality Engineering RepRisk Berlin, Deutschland Vor 1 Monat Software Test Engineer (all gender) | Python | PyTest | Jira/Xray | Linux | DO-178C | System Testing 100 Software Test Engineer (all gender) | Python | PyTest | Jira/Xray | Linux | DO-178C | System Testing 100 ALTEN Berlin, Deutschland Vor 1 Monat Software Tester (w/m/d) Software Tester (w/m/d) Burmester Audiosysteme GmbH Berlin 40.000,00 € - 50.000,00 € Vor 4 Monaten Software Test Automation Engineer (m/w/d) - Berlin Software Test Automation Engineer (m/w/d) - Berlin Nexus AG Berlin Vor 3 Wochen Quality Assurance Tester Quality Assurance Tester Swift Games Berlin, Deutschland Vor 2 Monaten Test Engineer Communication Management (all gender) Test Engineer Communication Management (all gender) ALTEN Berlin, Deutschland Vor 1 Woche Software Engineer in Test (Berlin) Software Engineer in Test (Berlin) Cresta Berlin Vor 1 Woche Software Test Engineer (f/m/d) Software Test Engineer (f/m/d) Straumann Group Berlin Vor 1 Woche Search QA Automation Test